    "    \"## Atom classifier\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Given any atom-shaped input, rank the most similar atoms in the corpus and predict an article.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The score for each candidate atom is:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **exact_score**: sum of IDF weights of tags shared exactly with the query\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **semantic_score**: sum of best semantic-similarity matches for tags not exactly matched\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **combined_score** = `alpha * exact_score + (1 - alpha) * semantic_score`\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`alpha=0.5` weights both channels equally. Raise alpha to trust exact matching more; lower it to trust semantic more.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
